Comment: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:20.05,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:22.40,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.83,0:22:25.47,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.47,0:22:27.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.85,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:33.26,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:38.37,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:45.53,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:52.54,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:55.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:23:00.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:02.66,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.66,0:23:05.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:08.08,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.29,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:13.67,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:15.13,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:16.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:19.01,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.51,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:21.20,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:24.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:27.97,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:20.05,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透过望远镜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:22.40,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注视着的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.83,0:22:25.47,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.47,0:22:27.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}仿佛颠倒一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.85,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}双脚无法踏实着地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:33.26,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上云端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}无处安放的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:38.37,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只会感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:45.53,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:52.54,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」这类的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:55.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}虽然没有任何效果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:23:00.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:02.66,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}还是忍不住会这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.66,0:23:05.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜欢你。喜欢？超喜欢。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:08.08,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能说得出口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.29,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:13.67,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作响的回忆
Comment: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:15.13,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:16.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不够 不够 还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:19.01,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分还不够
Comment: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.51,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:21.20,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想触碰 想触碰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:24.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的爱冻结之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:27.97,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}请你将它温暖起来
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
